<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus 1996 profit up 11.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus 1996 profit up 11.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			  741  vs     666</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)  32.6 vs   30.7</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		    20.0 vs   20.0</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs)		  30.0 vs   30.0</p>
<p>    Operating				  1,480  vs  1,472</p>
<p>    Exceptional losses			  66  vs     86</p>
<p>    Financial				    135  vs    112</p>
<p>NOTE - Canal Plus said it maintained its forecast of a 1997 net attributable result, after exceptionals, of near breakeven.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
